			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 751340301,
					"content": "呼，總算是結束了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340302,
					"content": "保護它的秘源機兵也安靜下來了呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340303,
					"content": "好吧，現在讓我們看看這個裡面到底是什麼東西！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340304,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340305,
					"content": "不要讓我失望哦…欸？又是一塊火磷石，原來這個東西不只一枚嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340306,
					"content": "唔，等等，包裹它的織卷看起來也很眼熟啊…就像是我們最開始在遺蹟外面的塔樓裡撿到的那個筆記。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340307,
					"content": "呀…呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340308,
					"content": "#哇，實在是太詭異了，{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}你也這樣覺得吧？{NICKNAME}{F#妳}{M#你}快看看上面寫什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340309,
					"content": "哇，竟然真的是之前那個冒險家留下來的筆記，「統律之心」說的就是這裡吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340310,
						751340312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340310,
					"content": "還有其他的可能。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340311
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340311,
					"content": "對啊，而且我們也在這裡找到了新的火磷石，說不定其他地方也會有很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340312,
					"content": "想不通的事情太多了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340313
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340313,
					"content": "對啊，而且綠寶把我們指引到這裡，難道是牠早就知道這下面還藏了一塊火磷石，所以想要讓我們拿到？真是搞不懂。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340314,
					"content": "嗚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340315,
					"content": "我們還是先回去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340316
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340316,
					"content": "唉…也對，綠寶一定會知道些什麼吧？而且也答應玻娜不管發現什麼都要先回去的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340317,
					"content": "帶回去給玻娜看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340318
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340318,
					"content": "唉…也對，如果給玻娜看看的話說不定會有什麼發現，而且也答應過她不管找到什麼都要先回去的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340319,
					"content": "我們趕快離開這裡吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
