				{
					"id": 751340401,
					"content": "哦哦，你們終於回來了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340402,
					"content": "所以你們在下面發現什麼了？快跟我說！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340403,
					"content": "其實…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340404,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們將在下面的經歷與發現告訴了玻娜…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340405
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340405,
					"content": "#欸？！{F#妳}{M#你}們是說在下面又找到了一枚火磷石？哇，我原本還以為我手上的是世上唯一的一枚。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340406,
					"content": "等下，該不會我手上這枚其實是贗品吧…唔，難怪這麼多年都沒發現它有什麼特殊的地方。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340407,
					"content": "不會吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340408
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340408,
					"content": "對啊，因為我們在下面找到的那塊也一樣，除了上面的花紋之外沒什麼特別的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340409,
					"content": "我們還發現了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340410,
					"content": "哦對，我們還發現了一本奇怪的筆記，看起來像是以前來到這裡的冒險家留下來的，妳要看看嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340411,
					"content": "冒險家的筆記？會來到這座詛咒之城的冒險家多半都是為了「回還之玉」而來，所以…我還是不要看好了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340412,
					"content": "嗯？但是上面提到了火磷石跟祭壇的事情，說不定會是…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340413,
					"content": "嗯嗯，我知道啦。就是因為這樣，在找到「回還之玉」前我才不想看那本筆記。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340414,
					"content": "欸？那又是為什麼？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340415,
					"content": "多年來有無數的冒險家為了尋找天蛇船和「回還之玉」而踏上征途…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340416,
					"content": "但他們無一例外地都失敗了，誰也沒能證明那艘天空之船真的存在。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340417,
					"content": "在人們看來那或許只是個虛妄的夢，是飽受深淵之苦的人們所寄託的幻想。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340418,
					"content": "所以他們的冒險不會被敘事人所記錄，他們的事蹟也不會被任何人歌頌。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340419,
					"content": "如果無法找到天蛇船、無法拿到「回還之玉」的話，那他們所做的一切就都沒有意義了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340420,
					"content": "旅途本身就有意義。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340421
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340421,
					"content": "#是嗎？{F#妳}{M#你}是這樣認為的啊？{F#妳}{M#你}這種體驗派的冒險家在納塔可不多見哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340422
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340422,
					"content": "雖說也是有一事無成的冒險家，但大部分人還是需要一些能夠證明自己的東西的，不是嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340423
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340423,
					"content": "經驗也是很重要的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340424
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340424,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}這種話是建立在那艘船真實存在的基礎上，假如世界上根本沒有什麼天蛇船呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340425
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340425,
					"content": "因此必須找到天蛇船才可以——無論是為了老爹，還是為了其他曾為此付出生命的冒險家們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340426,
					"content": "#而{F#妳}{M#你}們找到的那個筆記，無論究竟是誰留下來的，也只有在我們登上天蛇船之後才會獲得應有的價值。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340427,
					"content": "#所以哦，{NICKNAME}和小派蒙，要是我們真的可以找到天蛇船然後平安回來，{F#妳}{M#你}們一定要在那個冒險家協會好好宣傳我們的事蹟哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340428
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340428,
					"content": "交給派蒙吧，她很擅長。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340429
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340429,
					"content": "#什麼啦，{F#妳}{M#你}是想說我很擅長吹牛嗎？要是我們真的找到什麼傳說中的船，只要告訴凱瑟琳小姐的話都可以傳遍整個提瓦特了吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340430
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340430,
					"content": "交給我吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340431
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340431,
					"content": "嗯嗯，畢竟我們也算是傳奇冒險家哦。只要把我們的故事告訴哪個記者，馬上就會上報紙頭條吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340432
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340432,
					"content": "#交給{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340433
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340433,
					"content": "呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340434
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340434,
					"content": "雖然牠答應得是很開心啦，但牠就算想要宣傳也只能告訴龍冒險家吧…等等，龍也會有冒險家嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340435
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340435,
					"content": "#哈哈，真好，不過說了這麼多{F#妳}{M#你}們還沒有把{F#妳}{M#你}們找到的那枚火磷石拿出來看看哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340436
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340436,
					"content": "#對哦，{NICKNAME}，快把火磷石拿出來吧！不知道綠寶看到之後會不會想起些什麼來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340437
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340437,
					"content": "咕嚕…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340438
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「綠松石」"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340438,
					"content": "嗚呀…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340439
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340439,
					"content": "怎、怎麼回事啊？眼睛都要晃瞎了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340440
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340440,
					"content": "嘰！咕嘰！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340441
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「綠松石」"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340441,
					"content": "哇，但是綠寶好像突然恢復了活力的樣子！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340442
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340442,
					"content": "看起來可以用「超能特攻光線」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340443
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340443,
					"content": "#嗯？{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}是怎麼記住這麼誇張的名字的啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340444
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340444,
					"content": "不過，難道就像我們之前找到的那些能量碎屑一樣，火磷石就是用來儲存這種能量的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340445
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340445,
					"content": "看起來火磷石裡也蘊藏著那種能量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340446
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340446,
					"content": "對啊，難道就像我們之前找到的那些能量碎屑一樣，火磷石就是用來儲存這種能量的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340447
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340447,
					"content": "然後也是因為有了這種能量，綠寶才能對付深淵的嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340448
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340448,
					"content": "呀，呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340449
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340449,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，{F#妳}{M#你}們看看這個。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340450
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340450,
					"content": "欸，又出什麼事了？唔啊？！這個壁畫怎麼完全變樣了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340451
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340451,
					"content": "看來我們之前看到的壁畫其實是覆蓋在這個上面的呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340452
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340452,
					"content": "之前的壁畫上也有看到…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340453
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340453,
					"content": "對耶，這不就是我們在拿到第一塊「通牒金盤」的那個遺蹟裡，也有在壁畫上看到的那條大黑龍嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340454
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340454,
					"content": "看這上面畫的，好像這條大黑龍才是這裡的主人一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340455
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340455,
					"content": "龍盤踞在城市之上…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340456
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 751340456,
					"content": "看這上面畫的，好像那條壞龍才是這裡的主人一樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340457
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340457,
					"content": "嘰…咕！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340458
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「綠松石」"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340458,
					"content": "唔…綠寶想說什麼？你對這幅壁畫有什麼印象嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340459
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340459,
					"content": "咿！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340460
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「綠松石」"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340460,
					"content": "欸，這次的光是指向天空…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340461
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340461,
					"content": "咕咕！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340462
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「綠松石」"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340462,
					"content": "嗯嗯，不會錯了，源火祭壇一定就在那個方向，這座古城的最高處！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340463
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340463,
					"content": "真的假的？每次妳說得這麼確定我就有點擔心…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340464
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340464,
					"content": "唉呀，就再相信我一次嘛，我有預感，這次一定不會錯的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						751340465
					],
					"speakerTitle": "玻娜"
				},
				{
					"id": 751340465,
					"content": "竟然已經開始依靠預感了嗎…不過好吧，現在也只能相信妳了，我們上去看看吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				}
			]
		},
